      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR DISCO (5) has the hoof on the till after back-to-back seconds at this circuit and distance. Draws wider than when 1.7m away last week but was very good two back when he came from the back row to miss by a nose. Big chance to break through. TROUBADOUR NZ (9) made it three wins from four starts at this circuit and distance this time in when he came from the second line to score last start by a nose. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw but the form is hard to knock. CAPTAIN SAID SO (6) has finished runner-up in his last three outings here, the latest from the extreme outside barrier. Draws lower and a win could be imminent. LOU LAMOUR (11) placed here two back before a last-start win by 1.5 metres at Pinjarra. Can feature with even luck.",
